			"notes": "### Weather Clouds 1.1.0\n\n**Features & Mod Compat**\n- Added optional Snow! Real Magic! integration: snow clouds now cover slabs, stairs, fences, and plants when the mod is installed.\n\n**Visuals**\n- Extended precipitation render distance up to 48 blocks (up from vanilla's 10-block limit).\n- Fixed rain and snow stacking into an opaque wall when looking through multiple clouds.\n- Cloud blocks no longer block skylight or cast pitch-black shadows underneath.\n\n**Fixes & Performance**\n- Fixed vertically stacked clouds producing no weather; the bottom cloud now precipitates properly.\n- Multiple clouds in the same vertical column with gaps between them now each drop their own precipitation.\n- Fixed snow layers stopping accumulation at 2 layers in vanilla.\n- Fixed moving clouds with pistons leaving phantom weather behind.\n- Greatly improved rendering performance by caching columns instead of raycasting every frame.\n\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/andriyko69/Weather-Clouds/compare/1.0-1.21.1-neoforge...1.1.0-1.21.1-neoforge"
		},
